OL,3,AGiant whales move into Greenland waters
OL,4,Aas ice disappears
OL,5,
OL,6,FSea ice has been disappearing from East
OL,7,FGreenland, allowing giant whales to
OL,8,Ftake advantage and move into previously
OL,9,Finaccessible areas.
OL,11,FThat is the conclusion of a
OL,12,Fdecades-long study that has recorded -
OL,13,Fand filmed -  hundreds of the world's
OL,14,Fbiggest whales including humpbacks,
OL,15,Fminke and fin whales, feeding in
OL,16,Fice-free seas along the coast in
OL,17,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
