OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGiant whales move into Greenland waters
OL,4,Aas ice disappears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNone of these marine mammals were
OL,7,Fhistorically found here as they have
OL,8,Fbeen locked out of the coastal waters
OL,9,Fby ice. Now, as climate change warms
OL,10,Fthe sea and melts that ice, they have
OL,11,Fadapted.
OL,13,FScientists describe the result as
OL,14,Fseasonal Arctic "feeding frenzies" -
OL,15,Fpart of a major  regime shift in the
OL,16,Focean environment along East Greenland.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
